deployment.mdx","Desplegar Lamassu con un proxy frontal Traefik que sirve certificados clásicos, poscuánticos y composite, mediante los valores del chart o el instalador fast-lane.",{"_94":417},"platform/pqc/deployment.mdx",{"_71":419,"_78":115,"_91":-7,"_73":420},"es:_10","Pruebas de integración",{"_71":422,"_78":88,"_73":45,"_82":423,"_91":-7,"_11":44,"_92":424},"es:platform/pqc/integration-tests/overview.mdx","Evidencia de que software ajeno a Lamassu negocia intercambio de claves poscuántico y verifica los certificados poscuánticos y composite que sirve Lamassu.",{"_94":425},"platform/pqc/integration-tests/overview.mdx",{"_71":427,"_78":88,"_73":39,"_82":428,"_91":-7,"_11":38,"_92":429},"es:platform/pqc/integration-tests/https.mdx","Resultados de probar un endpoint HTTPS de Lamassu con OpenSSL y curl usando intercambio de claves poscuántico y certificados poscuánticos y composite.",{"_94":430},"platform/pqc/integration-tests/https.mdx",{"_71":432,"_78":88,"_73":42,"_82":433,"_91":-7,"_11":41,"_92":434},"es:platform/pqc/integration-tests/mqtts.mdx","Resultados de probar un broker MQTT detrás del proxy TLS de Lamassu con mosquitto, usando intercambio de claves poscuántico y certificados poscuánticos y composite.",{"_94":435},"platform/pqc/integration-tests/mqtts.mdx",{"_71":437,"_78":115,"_91":-7,"_73":438},"es:_11","Referencia",{"_71":440,"_78":88,"_73":51,"_82":441,"_91":-7,"_11":50,"_92":442},"es:platform/pqc/limitations.mdx","Qué está incompleto, es no estándar o no está verificado en el soporte poscuántico de Lamassu, agrupado por componente.",{"_94":443},"platform/pqc/limitations.mdx","es:platform/pqc",{"_229":446},"platform/pqc/meta.json","<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-atom shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1\"></circle><path d=\"M20.2 20.2